    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776620/extras/8ad31dc3603177cfaa7a767ef294e50d.avif?t=1751908032\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span>A true warrior never runs away from battle. Can you resist tough creatures and powerful bosses in a dark medieval world? Kill creatures, explore the cave, improve your weapons, become stronger and get out of the cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark Fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Weapons Upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various Gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Acquire Skills and Master Them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Improve Your Character's traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Win Tough Battles Against Bosses.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776620/extras/8ad31dc3603177cfaa7a767ef294e50d.avif?t=1751908032\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span>A true warrior never runs away from battle. Can you resist tough creatures and powerful bosses in a dark medieval world? Kill creatures, explore the cave, improve your weapons, become stronger and get out of the cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark Fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Weapons Upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various Gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Acquire Skills and Master Them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Improve Your Character's traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Win Tough Battles Against Bosses.</p>",
